  "verseCount": 42,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yonathani ogokoonya Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi agatama korwa Nayoti agwo Rama, akagenda ase Yonathani, akamobooria, “Ninki nakorire? Okomocha kwane, na ebibe biane mbiribi ase obosio bwa iso? Nase ki arigetie kong’ita?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonathani akamoiraneria, “Taibo, togokwa. Tata tari gokora gento kende gionsi, ekenene gose egeke, atantebeti. Nase ki tata arambise ring’ana erio, tamanyia? Ayio takoba bo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akairaneria ase ogotiana, agateeba, “Iso igo amanyete buya ng’a aye nonyanchete mono, na ororire ng’a tari buya akomanyie ring’ana erio, ekiagera nigo riragoichanie mono. Korende ekeene, buna Omonene are moyo, na buna aye ore moyo, ngetigarete egetambokero ekemo gioka egati yane na amakweri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yonathani akamoteebia, “Gento kende gionsi oganetie ningokorere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi agateebia Yonathani, “Ankio ne Rituko Rinene ri’Omotienyi Omoyia, nigo embetereretie ng’a ng’ikaranse koragera amo nomorwoti, korende ing’a ribaga ngende kwebisa agwo ase omogondo goika ankio ende mogoroba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kerabe ng’a iso tandochi ase omoyega oyio, omoteebie: Daudi nigo ansaba ribaga ng’a aminyoke gochia Bethlehemu, omochie oye, ase okorua ekeng’wanso ki’omwaka amo neamate yaye yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aise goteeba: Ayio mbuya, rirorio inche, omosomba oo, ninyare koba nomorembe, korende karaabe nendamwamu ase ayio, rirorio omanye ng’a bwerure gokora amabe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki onkorere inche, omosomba oo, amaya, ekiagera gwakorire okobwatana kw’ogotianania amo nainche ase obosio bw’Omonene. Korende onye okomocha kore ase ’nde, rirorio aye omonyene ong’ite. Nase ki okong’ira ase iso, erinde ere ang’ite?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonathani akairaneria, “Taibo! Takoba bo. Onye ndiria imanyete ekeene ng’a tata narengereretie kogokorera bobe, Inee, nanga rirorio tinagoteebia amang’ana ayio?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akamobooria, “Iso karakoiranerie amang’ana amakong’u, Inee, ning’o orache gonteebia ayio?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yonathani akamoteebia, “Inchuo togende ase egetii.” Bonsi babere bakagendao,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Yonathani akamoteebia Daudi. “Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, abe kirori ase aya. Ase chinsa buna echi, ankio gose ankio ende, nindigie komanya ebirengererio bia tata buna bire igoro yao, na kondabimanye, ningotomere amang’ana, erinde obimanye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye tata bwerure kogokorera bobe, rirori’Omonene ang’e inche Yonathani egesusuro onye tinkogoteebia okogania gwa tata, na ngotige otame na bwetoorie. Omonene abe amo naye buna arenge na tata",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye ngendererete koba moyo, oorokie obwanchani bw’Omonene ase ’nde, erinde tinkwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gose tobaisa korusia obwanchani obwo korwa ase ororeeria rwane nonya ng’ake, nonya neker’Omonene arasirie kera omobisa oo arue ase ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo Yonathani agakora okobwatana kw’ogotianania neamate ya Daudi, agateeba, Omonene nae ababisa ba Daudi egesusuro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yonathani akaboria Daudi arie eira na gotiana naende ng’a namwanche, ekiagera Yonathani nigo anchete Daudi buna eanchete ere omonyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yonathani agateebia Daudi, “Ankio ne Rituko Rinene ri’Omotienyi Omoyia, na ekiagera togochi‐gocha koba ase omoyega, ekerogo kiao nigo keratigare bosa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ankio ende otirimboke bwango gochia aase aria kwebisete rituko riria kwaganeirie. Obeere aroro, moino y’etui y’amagena aria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindute emegwe etato gochia ang’e netui eria, buna negento nkorasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio nintome omosomba one arigie emegwe eria. Kondateebie omosomba oria: Rigereia, emegwe nigo ere magega ao, gocha ensemo yane, genda oyerente, rirorio aye Daudi ochiche, obe nomorembe. Ekeene, buna Omonene are moyo, togokorerwa bobe bonde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende onye ngoteebia omwana oria: Rigereria, emegwe eyio bosio bwao aaria moino, rirorio aye Daudi otame, ekiagera ’Omonene okogoteebia ogende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nase amang’ana aria twakwanete, inche naye, tiga Omonene abe kirori ase egati yaito kogenderera botaambe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo Daudi akebisa mogondo na ekero ki’Omotienyi Omoyia omorwoti agaikaransa koragera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti agaikaransa ase ekerogo kiaye, ang’e nenyasi, buna botaambe; na Yonathani agatenena bosio bwaye, na Abineri agaikaransa ensemo ya Saulo. Korende ekerogo gia Daudi kegatigara bosa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo takwanete gento kende ase rituko riria, ekiagera nigo arengereretie ng’a ring’ana gete riamonyorire Daudi; ande tagachenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria kabere ri’omoyega bw’Omotienyi Omoyia, ekerogo gia Daudi nigo kiagendererete gotigara bosa, na Saulo akaboria Yonathani momura oye, “Nase ki momura o Yese atachete koragera igoro gose reero?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonathani akairaneria Saulo, “Daudi nigo amboria ribaga agende Bethlehemu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agateeba: Abanto b’eamate yane ngochia bare korua ekeng’wanso agwo ase omochie, na momura ominto onchikiire ng’a imbeo. Ase ayio, onye nanyorire ogwancherwa asore, ing’a ribaga ngende korora abaminto. Aya naro agera atachicha ase endagera yao, aye omorwoti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Saulo akaba nendamwamu enene ase Yonathani, akamoteebia, “Aye omwana bw’omokuungu omosaria, nimanyete ng’a kwabwatanire na mosinto o Yese, ase okwerentera obosooku, na obosooku bw’obogetirianda bwa nyoko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomanyete ng’a ekero mosinto o Yese agendererete koba moyo ase ense, aye tokonyara koba nomorembe, gose oborwoti tibokoba obwao. Ase ayio, toma Abanto bamondetere; ere goika akwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yonathani akamobooria, “Nase ki araitwe akwe? Ngento ki akorire?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo Saulo akaimokia ritimo akamoruta amobete. Bono Yonathani akamanya ng’a ise narigetie goita Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonathani akaimoka korwa ase emesa ore nendamwamu enene na tariete gento ase rituko erio ria kabere ri’Omotienyi Omoyia. Nigo abeete oichaanete ase engencho y’obosooku ise amokorerete ase okogania goita Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emambia ya kabere, Yonathani amo nomwana oria omomura, bakagenda mogondo, ase engaki konya bachikanire na Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agateebia omwana oria, “Minyoka origie emegwe eria nkoruta.” Ekero omwana oria arenge kominyoka, Yonathani akaruta omogwe, noro ogaeta igoro yaye, okagwa bosio bwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ekero omwana oria aigete aase omogwe oria ogwete, Yonathani agaaka eriogi, akamoteebia, “Omogwe oyio ore bosio bwao, aaria moino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yonathani akarangeria omomura oria, akamoteebia, “Minyoka bwango, tobaisa goteebana.” Na omwana oria agasangereria emegwe eria, erio akairana gocha ase omonene oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana oria tamanyete ng’a ninki engencho y’amang’ana ayio, korende Yonathani na Daudi mbayamanyete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonathani akaa omosae oria ebirwanero biaye akamoteebia, “Genda, obiire ase omochie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omwana oria achiire, Daudi akaoroka korwa ase etui aase ebisete, agatung’ama inse, akaumama na agekumba ara gatato. Erio Daudi na Yonathani bakanyunyuntana na korererana, korende Daudi akamenta korera mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yonathani akamoteebia, “genda nomorembe, na abe buna twatiananetie ase erieta ri’Omonene togateeba: Omonene abe kirori ase egati yao nainche, na ase egati y’ororeeria rwao na orwane, kogenderera botaambe.” Erio Daudi akaimoka, akarua agwo, akagenda, na Yonathani akairana ase omochie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
